### ============= PERMISSION TESTS =============

### Test 41: Teacher tries to get classes from other entity (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Test 42: Student tries to create class (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clase No Permitida",
  "subject_id": 1,
  "section_id": 1,
  "academic_year_id": 1,
  "max_students": 30,
  "weeks_duration": 16,
  "teachers": [1]
}

### Test 43: Teacher tries to record attendance for class not owned (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/records
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": 999,
  "student_id": 1,
  "status": "present"
}

### Test 44: admin_entity tries to access other entity's data (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminEntityToken}}
